  "description": "EventBuss is a high-performance, lightweight in-process messaging library for .NET applications. It provides a streamlined approach to implementing the mediator pattern using System.Threading.Channels for efficient event publishing and handling. Designed as a simpler alternative to MediatR, EventBuss enables clean separation of concerns with minimal overhead, making it ideal for implementing CQRS patterns and event-driven architectures without the complexity of pipelines.",
